    "title": "WVU women's basketball seeks big jump in year 4 under Kellogg | West Virginia University Sports | wvnews.com",
    "text": "MORGANTOWN, W. Va. — Over the past three years West Virginia has elbowed its way into the top level of women's basketball but has yet to elbow its way past the second round of the NCAA Championships.\nWith Coach Mark Kellogg starting his fourth season and owning 78-22 overall record to go along with a near 100% fan approval rating, he believes he is fielding his best team yet this season with more height and depth and looks to work out a deeper run into the NCAA Tournament and perhaps at last getting to play at home for at least the first two rounds.",
